(text "BUCK - RAA211450  |  Renesas (Intersil)  |  4.5-42V 5A synchronous buck, HTSSOP-16" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 14.00 0) (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b37ffd8e-49ec-4125-abe3-013b69d031eb"))
(text "Default build: VOUT = 3.3 V (fixed resistor divider - no trimmer). Other outputs: change only R_top/R_bot (and L where shown) per the VOUT table." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 19.30 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c628fa86-8ba0-4e2c-a5fe-436e26c6472c"))
(text "DESIGN EQUATIONS - RAA211450 (Renesas R16DS0183EU0102 Rev1.02, sections 5-6)\nDesign point: VIN 24 V nom (6-42 V), VOUT 3.3 V, IOUT 5 A, fSW 400 kHz, HTSSOP-16 (adjustable SS)\nFB divider (EQ.4): RFB1 = RFB2*(VOUT-0.8)/0.8, RFB2 = 20k -> RFB1 = 61.9k ; VOUT = 3.276 V\nFrequency: RFS = 261k -> 400 kHz (Table 1: 590k 200k, 374k 300k, 261k 400k, 205k 500k, 165k 600k, 121k 800k)\nInductor (EQ.6): L = 1000*VOUT(1-D)/(dIL*fSW[kHz]), dIL = 40% IOUT -> 3.56 uH ; Sec 2.3 table -> 3.3uH\n  dIL (EQ.5) = 2.16 A @24 V ; peak = 6.08 A (< HS peak limit 8.5 A)\nInput cap (EQ.7/8): IIN_RMS = IOUT*sqrt(D(1-D)) ; CIN = IOUT*D(1-D)/(fSW*dVIN)\nOutput cap: EQ.9 ripple (10 mV) 67.4 uF ; EQ.10 step-up 6.2 uF ; EQ.11 step-down 38.8 uF ; EQ.12 loop 65.9 uF\n  (ISTEP = 50% IOUT, dV = 5%) -> fitted 3x47uF/10V 1210 (~99 uF eff) per Sec 2.3\nSoft-start (EQ.1): tSS = CSS*VREF/ISS = 10nF*0.8V/5.3uA = 1.51 ms (house-common 10 nF)\nUVLO (EQ.2/3): RIN1 = RIN2*(VINR-1.25)/1.25, RIN2 = 100k, VINR 6.0 V -> 383k ; VINF = 1.125*(RIN1+RIN2)/RIN2 = 5.43 V\nEBIAS tied to VOUT (3.3-40 V aux LDO) ; VCC 2.2uF ; BOOT 0.1uF ; PG 10k pull-up to VOUT (<=3.3 V)\nGENERIC CHECKS @ VIN=24V nom / 42V max, VOUT=3.3V, IOUT=5A, fSW=400kHz\n  D = VOUT/VIN = 0.137\n  dIL = VOUT(1-VOUT/VIN)/(L*fSW): 2.16A @nom, 2.30A @max  (46% of IOUT)\n  IL_PK = IOUT + dIL/2 = 6.15A ; inductor ISAT must exceed 9.5A (max peak limit)  (XAL7070-332ME: ISAT 14A)\n  ICIN_RMS = IOUT*sqrt(D(1-D)) = 1.72A (max IOUT/2 = 2.50A at D=0.5)\n  dVIN = IOUT*D(1-D)/(fSW*CIN) = 494mV with CIN_eff=3uF\n  dVOUT_ripple = dIL/(8*fSW*COUT) = 6.8mV with COUT_eff=98.7uF (ESR excluded)\n  tON @VINmax = VOUT/(VIN*fSW) = 196ns vs tON_MIN(max)=96ns -> OK\n  Max VIN without pulse skipping = VOUT/(tON_MIN*fSW) = 85.9V\n  Min VIN (dropout) ~ (VOUT+IOUT*R)/(1-fSW*tOFF_MIN) = 3.89V\nIC THERMAL @ VIN nom, full load (datasheet Power Dissipation / thermal sections)\n  Pcond=IL_RMS^2*1.4*(D*RDS_HS+(1-D)*RDS_LS)=1.79W, Psw=0.5*VIN*IOUT*tsw*fSW=0.36W (tsw~15ns), Pq=0.07W\n  RDS_HS=115mOhm, RDS_LS=40mOhm typ (datasheet EC table)\n  PIC = 2.22W ; thetaJA = 35 C/W (JEDEC) -> TJ = TA + thetaJA*PIC = 103C @25C, 163C @85C ; TA(max) for TJ=125C = 47C\n  Inductor DCR loss = IOUT^2*DCR = 0.30W" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 165.10 0) (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f4ef84fd-77e7-44f3-b865-1294a6dcc02b"))
